---
---

<section class="final-cta">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">Pronto a scalare?</p>
      <h2 class="headline">
        Pronto a scalare<br />il tuo e-commerce?
      </h2>
      <p class="body-text">
        Una call di 30 minuti per capire se posso aiutarti.<br />
        Senza pressioni, senza pitch — solo un'analisi onesta della situazione.
      </p>
      <a href="/contatti" class="btn">Parliamoci</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .final-cta {
    padding: 8rem 0;
  }

  .inner {
    max-width: 620px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .headline {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.25rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .body-text {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-mid);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    background-color: var(--color-accent);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    padding: 0.9rem 2.25rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    border-radius: 2px;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
  }
  .btn:hover { opacity: 0.85; }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .final-cta {
      padding: 5rem 0;
    }
  }
</style>
